{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Archimedean.TauRhoHodgeLiftInterface","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TauRhoHodgeLiftInterface","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Matrix.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Matrix.Hermitian","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Trigonometric.Basic"],"declarations":9,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TauRhoHodgeLiftInterface.gauss_bonnet_bring_eq_inv_8pi","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TauRhoHodgeLiftInterface.gauss_bonnet_bring_eq_inv_8pi","kind":"theorem","line":117,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TauRhoHodgeLiftInterface.lean#L117-L125","doc":"The Gauss–Bonnet placement on Bring (`χ = −6`, `Area = 12π`):\n`|χ| / (4·Area) = 1/(8π)` — the merged GB identity's Bring instance, with the\nπ carried honestly. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TauRhoHodgeLiftInterface.half_a0_eq_inv_8pi","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TauRhoHodgeLiftInterface.half_a0_eq_inv_8pi","kind":"theorem","line":110,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TauRhoHodgeLiftInterface.lean#L110-L115","doc":"The measure identity with a genuine π: `½ · a₀ = 1/(8π)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TauRhoHodgeLiftInterface.TauRhoHodgeLift.doubled_total","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TauRhoHodgeLiftInterface.TauRhoHodgeLift.doubled_total","kind":"theorem","line":100,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TauRhoHodgeLiftInterface.lean#L100-L106","doc":"**Conditional theorem (doubled total).** The selected channel (`H^{1,0}`,\nthe FORCED shadow assignment) carries exactly half the pair total: the q→1\none-loop restores the doubled unit — bean B4's target statement. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TauRhoHodgeLiftInterface.TauRhoHodgeLift.equal_split","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TauRhoHodgeLiftInterface.TauRhoHodgeLift.equal_split","kind":"theorem","line":93,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TauRhoHodgeLiftInterface.lean#L93-L98","doc":"**Conditional theorem (equal split).** Given the lift, the loop weight\nsplits equally across the conjugate pair — the ½ is ρ-forced, derived from\nthe class fields (B4b, now in Mathlib generality). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TauRhoHodgeLiftInterface.TauRhoHodgeLift.conjugated","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TauRhoHodgeLiftInterface.TauRhoHodgeLift.conjugated","kind":"theorem","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TauRhoHodgeLiftInterface.lean#L87-L87","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TauRhoHodgeLiftInterface.TauRhoHodgeLift.hermitian","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TauRhoHodgeLiftInterface.TauRhoHodgeLift.hermitian","kind":"theorem","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TauRhoHodgeLiftInterface.lean#L86-L86","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TauRhoHodgeLiftInterface.TauRhoHodgeLift.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TauRhoHodgeLiftInterface.TauRhoHodgeLift.mk","kind":"ctor","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TauRhoHodgeLiftInterface.lean#L85-L85","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TauRhoHodgeLiftInterface.TauRhoHodgeLift","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TauRhoHodgeLiftInterface.TauRhoHodgeLift","kind":"class","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TauRhoHodgeLiftInterface.lean#L69-L87","doc":"**Primary conjecture — the B2 functorial lift, interface form.**\n\nParameters: `g` = complex dimension of `H^{1,0}(Bring)` (= 4), `W` = the\nloop's spectral weight on `H^{1,0}`, `Wbar` = the weight on `H^{0,1}`.\n\nFields (the lift's content — its *inputs*, not its conclusions):\n* `hermitian`: the `H^{1,0}` weight is hermitian — the loop weight comes from\n  a real (self-adjoint) Laplacian-type operator, the B3 inheritance;\n* `conjugated`: the `H^{0,1}` weight is the entrywise conjugate of the\n  `H^{1,0}` weight — τ carries the fibre reality structure ρ to the Hodge\n  conjugation (the B1 dictionary implemented functorially; its degenerate-\n  locus shadow is FORCED, PR #3960 `shadow_unique`).\n\nOPEN: no instance exists in the corpus. Exhibiting one for the actual α_EM\nloop weights (from the categorical τ-functor) IS the remaining wall of the\nper-loop measure `½·a₀ = 1/(8π)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Archimedean.TauRhoHodgeLiftInterface.trace_map_star_eq_of_isHermitian","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Archimedean.TauRhoHodgeLiftInterface.trace_map_star_eq_of_isHermitian","kind":"theorem","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Archimedean/TauRhoHodgeLiftInterface.lean#L59-L67","doc":"The ρ-split engine, Mathlib generality: an entrywise-conjugated hermitian\nmatrix has the same trace — reality forces the conjugate component's spectral\nweight to equal the original's. (Upgrade of B4b's concrete check.) ","signatureChunk":0}]}